{
  "_comment": [
    "What each animated background is made of, so a sheet can be rebuilt or retuned",
    "without reconstructing the command that made it: ./scripts/animate-background.py --all",
    "",
    "Effects are chosen for what motion cannot do. drift/pan/zoom are free and already",
    "on every theme, so a sheet only earns its texture budget by changing light or by",
    "moving something independently of the frame.",
    "",
    "amount is a ceiling: each build turns it down if the frames would dim brighter than",
    "the catalogue allows, since the frames are what text sits on."
  ],
